#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:2
msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "Agendamento"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:7
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides scheduling capabilities for various operational "
"tasks, allowing administrators to automate routine activities and manage "
"resource lifecycle timing. Scheduling features are available across "
"several areas of the platform."
msgstr "|morpheus| fornece capacidades de agendamento para várias tarefas operacionais, permitindo que os administradores automatizem atividades de rotina e gerenciem o timing do ciclo de vida dos recursos. Os recursos de agendamento estão disponíveis em várias áreas da plataforma."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:10
msgid "Execute Schedules"
msgstr "Execute Schedules"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:12
msgid ""
"Execute Schedules define time windows during which automated tasks, jobs,"
" and workflows are permitted to run. They act as execution policies that "
"control when automation can execute."
msgstr "Execute Schedules definem janelas de tempo durante as quais tasks, jobs e workflows automatizados têm permissão para ser executados. Eles atuam como políticas de execução que controlam quando a automação pode ser executada."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:14
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Automation` > Execute "
"Schedules to manage execute schedule definitions."
msgstr "Navegue até :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Automation` > Execute Schedules para gerenciar definições de execute schedule."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:17
msgid "Creating an Execute Schedule"
msgstr "Criando um Execute Schedule"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:19
msgid "Navigate to Provisioning > Automation > Execute Schedules"
msgstr "Navegue até Provisioning > Automation > Execute Schedules"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:20 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:54
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:21 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:55
msgid "Configure the schedule:"
msgstr "Configure o agendamento:"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:23 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:57
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:24
msgid "A descriptive name for the execute schedule."
msgstr "Um nome descritivo para o execute schedule."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:26 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:60
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:27
msgid "Optional description of when and why this schedule is used."
msgstr "Descrição opcional de quando e por que este agendamento é usado."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:29 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:63
msgid "SCHEDULE TYPE"
msgstr "SCHEDULE TYPE"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:30
msgid "The type of schedule definition:"
msgstr "O tipo de definição de agendamento:"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:32
msgid "**Date and Time** — A specific date/time window"
msgstr "**Date and Time** — Uma janela específica de data/hora"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:33
msgid "**Day of Week** — Recurring on specific days of the week with time windows"
msgstr "**Day of Week** — Recorrente em dias específicos da semana com janelas de tempo"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:35 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:68
msgid "TIME ZONE"
msgstr "TIME ZONE"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:36
msgid "The time zone for the schedule definition."
msgstr "O fuso horário para a definição do agendamento."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:38 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:77
msgid "ENABLED"
msgstr "ENABLED"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:39 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:78
msgid "Toggle to enable or disable the schedule."
msgstr "Alterne para ativar ou desativar o agendamento."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:41 ../../operations/scheduling.rst:80
#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:111
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:44
msgid "Power Schedules"
msgstr "Power Schedules"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:46
msgid ""
"Power Schedules automate the start and stop of Instances and Servers "
"based on defined time windows. This is commonly used to shut down non-"
"production environments outside business hours to reduce costs."
msgstr "Power Schedules automatizam o início e a parada de Instâncias e Servidores com base em janelas de tempo definidas. Isso é comumente usado para desligar ambientes de não produção fora do horário comercial para reduzir custos."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:48
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Automation` > Power "
"Schedules to manage power schedule definitions."
msgstr "Navegue até :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Automation` > Power Schedules para gerenciar definições de power schedule."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:51
msgid "Creating a Power Schedule"
msgstr "Criando um Power Schedule"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:53
msgid "Navigate to Provisioning > Automation > Power Schedules"
msgstr "Navegue até Provisioning > Automation > Power Schedules"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:58
msgid "A descriptive name for the power schedule."
msgstr "Um nome descritivo para o power schedule."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:61
msgid "Optional description."
msgstr "Descrição opcional."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:64
msgid "**Power On** — Start resources during the defined window"
msgstr "**Power On** — Iniciar recursos durante a janela definida"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:65
msgid "**Power Off** — Stop resources during the defined window"
msgstr "**Power Off** — Parar recursos durante a janela definida"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:66
msgid "**Custom** — Define specific on/off times"
msgstr "**Custom** — Definir horários específicos de ligar/desligar"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:69
msgid "The time zone for the schedule."
msgstr "O fuso horário para o agendamento."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:71
msgid "DAYS"
msgstr "DAYS"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:72
msgid "Select which days of the week the schedule is active."
msgstr "Selecione em quais dias da semana o agendamento está ativo."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:74
msgid "START TIME / END TIME"
msgstr "START TIME / END TIME"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:75
msgid "The time window during which the power action applies."
msgstr "A janela de tempo durante a qual a ação de energia se aplica."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:83
msgid "Assigning Power Schedules"
msgstr "Atribuindo Power Schedules"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:85
msgid "Power schedules can be assigned to:"
msgstr "Power schedules podem ser atribuídos a:"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:87
msgid "**Instances** — Via the Instance detail page or during provisioning"
msgstr "**Instances** — Via a página de detalhes da Instância ou durante o provisionamento"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:88
msgid "**Servers** — Via the Server detail page"
msgstr "**Servers** — Via a página de detalhes do Servidor"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:90
msgid ""
"Assigned resources will automatically start or stop according to the "
"schedule definition."
msgstr "Os recursos atribuídos iniciarão ou pararão automaticamente de acordo com a definição do agendamento."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:93
msgid "Instance Schedules"
msgstr "Agendamentos de Instância"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:95
msgid ""
"Individual Instances can have schedules assigned for lifecycle "
"management, including:"
msgstr "Instâncias individuais podem ter agendamentos atribuídos para gerenciamento do ciclo de vida, incluindo:"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:97
msgid "**Expiration dates** — Auto-terminate instances after a defined period"
msgstr "**Expiration dates** — Encerrar automaticamente instâncias após um período definido"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:98
msgid "**Shutdown schedules** — Auto-stop instances at specified times"
msgstr "**Shutdown schedules** — Parar automaticamente instâncias em horários especificados"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:99
msgid ""
"**Extension requests** — Users can request extensions to scheduled "
"expirations"
msgstr "**Extension requests** — Usuários podem solicitar extensões de expirações agendadas"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:101
msgid ""
"Instance schedules are configured on the Instance detail page or enforced"
" through policies."
msgstr "Os agendamentos de Instância são configurados na página de detalhes da Instância ou aplicados por meio de políticas."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:104
msgid "Report Schedules"
msgstr "Agendamentos de Relatório"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:106
msgid "Reports can be scheduled for automatic generation on recurring intervals:"
msgstr "Os relatórios podem ser agendados para geração automática em intervalos recorrentes:"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:108
msgid "Navigate to |OpRep|"
msgstr "Navegue até |OpRep|"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:109
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SCHEDULE` next to the desired report type"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`SCHEDULE` ao lado do tipo de relatório desejado"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:110
msgid "Configure the report parameters and schedule frequency"
msgstr "Configure os parâmetros do relatório e a frequência do agendamento"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:113
msgid ""
"Scheduled reports generate automatically and appear in the report history"
" for the selected report type."
msgstr "Os relatórios agendados são gerados automaticamente e aparecem no histórico de relatórios do tipo de relatório selecionado."

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:116
msgid "Job Schedules"
msgstr "Agendamentos de Job"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:118
msgid ""
"Jobs (Provisioning > Jobs) support schedule configuration for recurring "
"execution of tasks and workflows:"
msgstr "Jobs (Provisioning > Jobs) oferecem suporte a configuração de agendamento para execução recorrente de tasks e workflows:"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:120
msgid "**Manual** — Execute on demand only"
msgstr "**Manual** — Executar apenas sob demanda"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:121
msgid "**Date and Time** — Execute once at a specific date/time"
msgstr "**Date and Time** — Executar uma vez em uma data/hora específica"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:122
msgid ""
"**Schedule** — Execute on a recurring schedule (references Execute "
"Schedules)"
msgstr "**Schedule** — Executar em um agendamento recorrente (referencia Execute Schedules)"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:125
msgid "Policies and Scheduling"
msgstr "Políticas e Agendamento"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:127
msgid "Several policy types leverage scheduling:"
msgstr "Vários tipos de política aproveitam o agendamento:"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:129
msgid ""
"**Power Schedule policies** — Enforce power schedules at the Group or "
"Cloud level"
msgstr "**Power Schedule policies** — Aplicar power schedules no nível de Grupo ou Nuvem"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:130
msgid "**Expiration policies** — Set maximum instance lifetimes"
msgstr "**Expiration policies** — Definir tempos de vida máximos de instância"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:131
msgid "**Shutdown policies** — Enforce automatic shutdowns after defined periods"
msgstr "**Shutdown policies** — Aplicar desligamentos automáticos após períodos definidos"

#: ../../operations/scheduling.rst:133
msgid ""
"These are configured under Infrastructure > Groups > Policies or "
"Infrastructure > Clouds > Policies."
msgstr "Estes são configurados em Infrastructure > Groups > Policies ou Infrastructure > Clouds > Policies."

